          "type": "mcq",
          "text": "<p>What is the output of the following program?<br/>\n                        void main(){<br/>\n                          int a;<br/>\n                          a=1;<br/>\n                          while(a&lt;=1)<br/>\n                            if(a%2)<br/>\n                              printf(\"%d\", a++);<br/>\n                            else<br/>\n                              printf(\"%d\", ++a);<br/>\n                          printf(\"%d\", a+10);<br/>\n                        }</p>",
          "options": [
            "011",
